# Branch cloud-work (Virginie 2026-11-08: everything but Build, to work in the cloud and not only locally). The full list of
# what main keeps out of git, and why (art that grants no licence, ATTRIBUTION.md), is the .gitignore of main.

# Build intermediates. Directory.Build.props sends them outside the published folder: Mod/ goes
# to the Workshop as it stands, so an obj/ left there would ship the publicised Assembly-CSharp.dll.
build/
Source/**/obj/
Source/**/bin/
*.pdb

# Windows Explorer folder settings.
desktop.ini

# Over GitHub's 100 MB limit per file (1.6 GB of log).
Art/work/transfer-proto/s15B.log
